1A|05 01 65|See p. 21.|[SET > Network] Send/read the IP Address (RF Deck)|(valid after restart) setting LValid when the DHCP (valid after restart) is set to OFF. LYou cannot set the same address as "IP Address (LAN)," "IP Address (Controller)," and "Default Gateway." LWhen "RF deck's static IP address" (1A 05 01 71) is set to command "01," set the address to 1A 05 01 72.
